AB  - This paper presents AutoSaver to balance the performance and resource utilization for a web application in virtualization environment. It consists of a feedback utilization controller, an ARMA-based model estimator and an optimizer. Experiment results show that the controller can maintain the utilization, the estimator can track the relationship between metrics and control knobs, and the optimizer can make trade-offs between performance and resource of the web application.
