T1  - Text information hiding method. based on chaotic map and BCH code in DWT domain of a carrier image
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE FIRST INTERNATIONAL SYMPOSIUM ON DATA, PRIVACY, AND E-COMMERCE
PY  - 2007
SP  - 239
EP  - +
AB  - The issue of Information security in the transmit process becomes more and more urgent with the development of the network technology and the information technology. A novel scheme for text information hiding is proposed in the paper. Firstly, we encode the characters of the text information by ASCII code and receive plaintext information codes. Secondly, we encrypt the plaintext information codes by chaotic encryption method and receive encryption information codes. Then we encode the encrypted information codes by BCH code again before we transmit them, and embed the ciphertext informaiion into the selected wavelet coefficients of a carrier image in DWT domain. Finally, we do many experiments to prove our scheme to be secure and robust.
